Package: robustExpDesign
Title: Robust Experimental Design with Observational Evidence
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Aristotelis", "Epanomeritakis", role = "aut"),
    person("Davide", "Viviano", role = "aut"),
    person("Oleksandr", "Stasovskyi", email = "ostasovskyi@college.harvard.edu", role = c("cre", "ctb"))
    )
Description: Provides tools for designing experiments that combine
    experimental evidence with observational or external evidence under
    potential misspecification. Implements minimax proportional-regret
    experiment selection, variance-optimal benchmarks, budget sweeps,
    moment-selection and GMM weighting routines, finite-grid audience-regret
    designs, and diagnostics for sample allocation and estimator weights.
